```
# 止蝕
(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:喺投資或者交易入面，當睇到情況唔好，為咗減少損失，盡快賣出或者平倉。
eng:to cut losses; to limit losses
<eg>
yue:佢見個股價跌得好犀利，決定止蝕。 (keoi5 gin3 go3 guk3 ga3 dit3 dak1 hou2 sai1 lei6, gwit3 ding6 ji2 sik1.)
eng:He saw that the stock price was falling rapidly, so he decided to cut his losses.
```
 [end of text]


